# The repo root .gitignore ignores *.json for data artifacts. These files are
# NOT artifacts of a run: they are built once from Census downloads by
# mentat/tools/build_district_geo.py and shipped with the console, like
# app/index.html. Without this negation `git add mentat/app/geo` adds nothing
# and the map 404s on a fresh checkout.
!*.json

# Geo v2 bulk tiers (2026-09-26, lane G proposal): per-state detail and the z5/z10 web tiles
# regenerate from the Census files in mentat/.cache/geo with
# `python mentat/tools/build_geo_layers.py` (then --install); v2/index.json lists every file
# with its sha256, so a missing one is detectable.
v2/albers/detail/
v2/wgs84/z5/
v2/wgs84/z10/
